# i18n & Accessibility

## i18n
- ✅ No hardcoded user-facing strings
- ✅ Use `intl` + ARB workflow
- ✅ Keep keys consistent and feature-scoped

## Accessibility
- ✅ Add semantics labels for icon-only buttons and custom widgets
- ✅ Respect text scaling (avoid fixed heights that clip)
- ✅ Ensure tap targets are usable

## NEVER
- ❌ Build UI that breaks at larger font sizes
- ❌ Ship screens with missing semantics on critical controls
